{"id":"eben","lemma":"eben","pos":"adv","rank":363,"glosses":["just, simply, indicating that something is generally known or cannot be changed, and is therefore to be accepted; often equivalent to a shrug","just, quickly, indicating that something is done fast or without much complication","just; a moment ago"],"ipa":"/eːbən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/21/De-eben.ogg/De-eben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was hast du eben gesagt?","en":"What did you just say?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]},{"text":"So ist es eben.","en":"That's how it is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393453","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Es ist eben ein wenig weiter.","en":"It's just a little further.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"little, few"},{"g":"further, farther, more"}]},{"text":"So bin ich eben.","en":"That's just how I am.","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du eben warten?","en":"Would you mind waiting a few minutes?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to wait"}]}]}